{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementris is like Tetris, but the element of color finally got a meaning</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles of the same color don't go together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place up to 20 different shapes of 4 different colors on the grid without a gap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes can be anything from dominoes to pentominoes, depending on your skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amend your mistakes with helpful power-ups like the Eraser, the Hammer and the Colorizer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills in 2 different game modes as the game gets faster and faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the direction of gravity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version of Elementris offers the same experience as the full version, but it aborts after finishing Level 5.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522840?t=1756842508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522840?t=1756842508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522840/e4f0d9d4407b5741fb5b890d926373eb1743c36c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756842508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522840/e4f0d9d4407b5741fb5b890d926373eb1743c36c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756842508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementris is like Tetris, but the element of color finally got a meaning</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles of the same color don't go together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place up to 20 different shapes of 4 different colors on the grid without a gap</p></li><li><p cl